# HomeInventory — Home Inventory for Insurance Claims

An offline, single-file web app that catalogs your belongings room by room and
generates a claim-ready insurance report. No account, no subscription, no internet
needed — open `index.html` in any browser (even from `file://`) and it just works.

## What it does

- **Rooms** — add, rename, and delete rooms. Each room shows its item count and total
  documented value. Rooms with items can't be deleted until emptied.
- **Item catalog** — name, category, purchase value, serial number, purchase date,
  receipt/note, and a photo (stored on this device, downscaled to keep storage small).
- **Per-room and grand totals** — every total is computed live and shown in dollars.
- **Claim-ready report** — room-by-room table with item, category, serial, purchase
  date, and value, plus a grand total. Print / Save as PDF prints only the report.
- **Search and room filter** — find items by name, serial, note, category, or room.
- **Dark mode** — visible toggle, follows your system preference on first load, remembered.
- **Your data stays yours** — everything is saved in the browser's localStorage on your
  device. Export a JSON backup any time; import it to restore or move devices.
- **Print / PDF** — a clean print stylesheet produces the claim report only.

## Files

- `index.html` — the whole app (single file, zero external requests)
- `gallery/` — screenshots for the listing

## Privacy

No analytics, no network requests, no cookies. The only link in the app is the discreet
"by Glenerds" attribution in the footer.

